# Play test of The Sunken Archive (CIPlay sunken_archive, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the jetty
# (0.55 m) at the reading room's door on the archive's north face, the reading room (0.5 m), the flooded stacks below
# (floors at -2.55 and -5.6 m, broken windows), the air pocket in the deepest room.
island The Sunken Archive
expect step 0
expect title Card Catalogue

# Along the jetty into the reading room: the archivist's letter
walk -6 0 to -6.5 -6 to -6.5 -9.5 h=0.5
zone readingroom
expect step 1
read Archivist's letter
expect step 2

# The flooded stacks: two card boxes on the upper flooded floor, the third in the deepest room (its air pocket)
at -6 -14.5 h=-1.4
open Shelf card box
at -3.6 -9.5 h=-1.4
open Floor card box
at -4.5 -14.5 h=-4.4
air deepair
open Deep card box
expect story card 3
expect step 3

# Up in the reading room: the cards through the index desk; down to the vault's keeper and the vault
use indexterminal
expect message whirrs
expect story card 0
zone vault
kill Angler fish
expect step 4
open Rare book vault
expect item Blueprint_EngineControls 1
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineBase 1
expect done
